+Outputs: Final pixel color $C_{final}$ [G].
+Data Structures: Accumulators $C_{acc}$ (vec3, initialized to 0) and $\alpha_{acc}$ (float, initialized to 0) [G]. Transmittance $T$ (float, initialized to 1.0) [G].
+Algorithm:
